# speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
(There's tons of customers lining up for my new dish! Nasi Lemak!)

# speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
(It was risky... But it turned out to be a great decision! Business is booming! Wait... is that the delivery driver from last time?)

# speaker:Krab Rider # slot:right
I thought I smelt something nostalgic!

# speaker:Krab Rider # slot:right
Boss! Is that nasi lemak? How did you get ahold of the ingredients to make it? Nasi Lemak satu please.

# speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
No problem bang, coming right up!

# speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
(He seems happy. Is that... Another Malaysian? Does the smell of nasi lemak attract them or something?)

# speaker:Maggi Rider # slot:right
Wah! A fellow Malaysian! Macam ada nasi lemak some more. But I'm craving something different.

# speaker:Maggi Rider # slot:right
But I want something different leh... You know that Fishy... Soury... Noodle broth, Asam Laksa? You got sell that ah?

# speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
No... Not yet. But since it's coming from another Malaysian. I'll do my best. Come back in a few days.

# speaker:Maggi Rider # slot:right
Okok. You promise one ah bang. And if you manage to make it, I'll definitely recommend you to the rest of my brothers.

# speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
